{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0208","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000000f4:text","row":29712,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"あっという間に昼になった。","en":"In no time at all, it was lunchtime.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800533","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00001","en":"And in the blink of an eye it became noon.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000126:text","row":29713,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"やっぱり８人しかいないと、なかなか出くわさない。","en":"With only eight people around, you could go quite a while without running into anyone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800534","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00002","en":"Naturally, with only eight people there's no readily coming across each other.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000016e:text","row":29714,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんのサンドイッチ。","en":"Youko's sandwiches.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800535","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00003","en":"Youko-chan's sandwiches...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000001a0:text","row":29715,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょっと量が多い。","en":"There was a little too much.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800536","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00004","en":"There's kind of a lot of 'em.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000001d2:text","row":29716,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「仕方ない、一人で食うか……」","en":"“No helping it. Guess I'll eat them all myself...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800537","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00005","en":"Taichi: \"Nothing I can do, I'll eat them alone I guess...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000208:text","row":29717,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"なんとか食えるだろう。成長期だし。","en":"I could probably manage. I was still growing, after all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800538","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00006","en":"I gotta eat something. It's my growth period.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","undertranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the speaker should somehow be able to eat or finish the available amount; the English only states a generic need to eat something.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":45,"start":0,"text":"I gotta eat something. It's my growth period."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000254:text","row":29718,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"唐突にぞわっと背筋が総毛立つ。","en":"A sudden chill prickled up my spine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800539","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00007","en":"Suddenly, a shiver gives me goosebumps along my spine,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000028a:text","row":29719,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"機関銃を構えた兵士に背後から狙われているような。","en":"As if a soldier had a machine gun trained on me from behind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800540","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00008","en":"as if a soldier were targeting me from the back with a machine gun at the ready.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000033b:text","row":29720,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「よ、曜子ちゃん……」","en":"“Y-Youko...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800541","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Yo-, Youko-chan...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000371:text","row":29721,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800542","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00010","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000395:text","row":29722,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"立っていた。","en":"There she stood.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800543","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00011","en":"She stood.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000003b9:text","row":29723,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"立っているだけだった。","en":"Just standing there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800544","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00012","en":"She naught but stood.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000003e7:text","row":29724,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"いつものアプローチ。","en":"Her usual approach.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800545","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00013","en":"Her approach of always.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000413:text","row":29725,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"気配に鋭敏な体質のせいか、どうも慣れることがない。","en":"Maybe my sensitivity to other people’s presence was to blame, but I never got used to it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800546","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00014","en":"Perhaps because of a predisposition to being sensitive to presences, this is something I can't get used to.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000465:text","row":29726,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「いつもながら唐突だね」","en":"“Sudden as ever.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800547","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Always out of a sudden innit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000004fe:text","row":29727,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800548","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00016","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000522:text","row":29728,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"鼻をつまむ。","en":"I pinched her nose.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800549","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00017","en":"I pinch her nose.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000054e:text","row":29729,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「喋れ」","en":"“Talk.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800550","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Talk!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000005f4:text","row":29730,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「わらしのことがひつようらろおもっれ」","en":"“I thoughd you'd deed mbe.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800551","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00019","en":"Youko: \"I Dought Dat I was Deeded.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000063a:text","row":29731,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「うーん」","en":"“Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800552","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Hmmm.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000065c:text","row":29732,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"考える。","en":"I thought it over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800553","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00021","en":"Thinking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000684:text","row":29733,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「特に用事はないや」","en":"“I don’t need anything in particular.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800554","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00022","en":"Taichi: \"I don't really have anything I need you for.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000719:text","row":29734,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800555","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00023","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000073d:text","row":29735,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"手を離した隙に、２メートルほど逃げて立っていた。","en":"The instant I let go, she darted two meters back and resumed her post.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00024","en":"In the chance given by my hand being released, she ends up escaping to about 2 meters away with a bounce.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000078d:text","row":29736,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「それにしても一人で二人分食べるのは、大変だなあ」","en":"“Still, eating enough for two all by myself will be tough.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800556","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00026","en":"Taichi: \"That being said, eating a double portion alone, man what a problem.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000007d7:text","row":29737,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"紙袋をあけて、サンドを口に放り込む。","en":"I opened the paper bag and popped a sandwich into my mouth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800557","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00027","en":"I open the paper bag, and toss a 'wich in my mouth.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000081b:text","row":29738,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“……………………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800558","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00028","en":"Youko: \"............\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000847:text","row":29739,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"能面めいた顔の下、どんな葛藤が展開されているのだろうか。","en":"What conflict raged beneath that Noh-mask face?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800559","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00029","en":"What kind of conflict could even be unfolding under that noh mask of a face?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000897:text","row":29740,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"しばし後、わずかに肩が落ちる。","en":"After a moment, her shoulders drooped ever so slightly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800560","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00030","en":"Shortly after that, her shoulders drop a little.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000008cd:text","row":29741,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"しょんぼりと。","en":"Dejectedly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800561","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00031","en":"In disheartenment.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000979:text","row":29742,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「……私のアパート、引き払うことにしたから」","en":"“...I've decided to move out of my apartment.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800562","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00032","en":"Youko: \"...I have vacated my apartment.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000009c5:text","row":29743,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「え、どうして？」","en":"“What? Why?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800563","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Eh, how come?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000a75:text","row":29744,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「帰る」","en":"“I'm coming home.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800564","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00034","en":"Youko: \"Going home.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000a9d:text","row":29745,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「うちに？」","en":"“To our place?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800565","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00035","en":"Taichi: \"Mine?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000ac1:text","row":29746,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"頷く。","en":"She nodded.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800566","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00036","en":"Nod.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000ae7:text","row":29747,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ダメ」","en":"“...No.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800567","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00037","en":"Taichi: \"...not happening.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000b0b:text","row":29748,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"駄目だしをする。","en":"I vetoed the idea.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800568","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00038","en":"Begin rebuking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000b58:text","row":29749,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうして？」","en":"“...Why not?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800569","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00039","en":"Youko: \"...but why?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000b8a:text","row":29750,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「落ち着かない」","en":"“I can’t relax.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800570","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00040","en":"Taichi: \"I'll be ill at ease.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000bd7:text","row":29751,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「もう誰もいないから……元通り一緒に暮らしてもいいと思う……」","en":"“There's no one else left... I thought it would be all right for us to live together again...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800571","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00041","en":"Youko: \"Because there's no one anymore... I thought it would be best to live together as before...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000c35:text","row":29752,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「一人でのびのびと暮らせばいいと思う」","en":"“I think you should enjoy having a place to yourself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800572","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00042","en":"Taichi: \"I think living all carefree on my own is better.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000c73:text","row":29753,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"意見が別れた。","en":"We disagreed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800573","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00043","en":"Opinions were split.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000c99:text","row":29754,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"苦虫を噛みつぶしたような顔（の曜子版／ほぼ無表情）をする。","en":"She made the Youko version of a sour face: almost no expression at all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800574","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00044","en":"She makes a sour face as if she had bit into a bitterbug (Youko Edition/Nearly Expressionless).","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000d71:text","row":29755,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一はいつも私を邪険にする」","en":"“...You always push me away.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800575","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00045","en":"Youko: \"...Taichi is so cruel to me all the time.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000db3:text","row":29756,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「そっちが過保護すぎるの」","en":"“You're the one who's too protective.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800576","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00046","en":"Taichi: \"And you're excessively overprotective.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000e6b:text","row":29757,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「当たり前のことをしているだけだと思う」","en":"“I think I'm only doing what's natural.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800577","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00047","en":"Youko: \"I'm only doing what is normal, I think.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000eab:text","row":29758,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"そうかもしれんが。","en":"Maybe she was.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800578","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00048","en":"So she says, but is she now?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese concedes that the preceding claim may be true before qualifying it; the English recasts the clause as skepticism about what someone says.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":0,"text":"So she says, but is she now?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000edd:text","row":29759,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「とにかくダメ。俺は一人暮らしを満喫するの」","en":"“Anyway, no. I'm going to enjoy living alone.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800579","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00049","en":"Taichi: \"Regardless, not happening. I will be having my fill of living alone.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000fa7:text","row":29760,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………そう」","en":"“…………I see.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800580","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00050","en":"Youko: \"......right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000fcf:text","row":29761,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"しょんぼり。","en":"Gloom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800581","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00051","en":"Disheartened.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00000ff3:text","row":29762,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"そんなションボリズムにひたる少女を横目に、俺はサンドイッチを食う。","en":"Keeping one eye on the girl steeped in Gloomism, I ate my sandwich.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800582","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00052","en":"Giving a sidelong glance to this girl so immersed in Disheartenism, I chomp on a sandwich.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000010c3:text","row":29763,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800583","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00053","en":"Youko: \"...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000010e3:text","row":29764,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"じっと見られる。","en":"She watched me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800584","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00054","en":"Fixedly stared at.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001113:text","row":29765,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800585","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00055","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001137:text","row":29766,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"見られ続ける。","en":"She kept watching me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800586","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00056","en":"Continuously stared at.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001165:text","row":29767,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“……………………”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800587","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00057","en":"Youko: \"............\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001191:text","row":29768,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"見られ抜く。","en":"She watched the hell out of me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800588","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00058","en":"Stared at all the way to the end.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001241:text","row":29769,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんの腹の音だった。","en":"The sound had come from Youko's stomach.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800589","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00059","en":"That was Youko-chan's belly sound.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000127b:text","row":29770,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「……お昼は？」","en":"“...What about lunch?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800590","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00060","en":"Taichi: \"...lunch?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000012c8:text","row":29771,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「食べてない」","en":"“No.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800591","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00061","en":"Youko: \"Did not have.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000012f6:text","row":29772,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「たいへんだね」","en":"“That's rough.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800592","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00062","en":"Taichi: \"Oh, what a problem.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001343:text","row":29773,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「さっき、仕方なく一人で食べる、という意味の発言を聞いたんだけど」","en":"“A moment ago, I believe I heard you say you had no choice but to eat alone.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800593","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00063","en":"Youko: \"However, earlier I heard words to the meaning that there's nothing you can do, and need to eat alone.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000013a5:text","row":29774,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「言ったよ」","en":"“I did.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800594","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00064","en":"Taichi: \"'Cause I said 'em.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese means 'I did say that'; the English adds an unsupported causal connector and an unclear plural object.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"'Cause I said 'em.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000013c9:text","row":29775,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"もぐもぐもぐもぐ","en":"Munch munch munch munch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800595","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00065","en":"Munch, munch, munch, munch.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000013f9:text","row":29776,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「まさに今、そうしているとこさ」","en":"“And that is precisely what I am doing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800596","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00066","en":"Taichi: \"And now, that is exactly what I am doing.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001456:text","row":29777,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ここには二人の人間がいるというのに」","en":"“...Even though there are two people here.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800597","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00067","en":"Youko: \"...when there are two humans here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000014a0:text","row":29778,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんだって？　よく聞こえなかった？」","en":"“What was that? I didn’t quite catch it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800598","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00068","en":"Taichi: \"Whatd'ja say? Something wasn't heard right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001564:text","row":29779,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一はすぐいじわるをする……」","en":"“...You're always so mean to me...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800599","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00069","en":"Youko: \"...Taichi bullies me straight away...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000015a8:text","row":29780,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「おいしいなあ」","en":"“Mm, delicious.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800600","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00070","en":"Taichi: \"Way delicious.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000015d0:text","row":29781,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"もぐもぐもぐもぐ","en":"Munch munch munch munch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800601","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00071","en":"Munch, munch, munch, munch.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001600:text","row":29782,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800602","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00072","en":"Youko: \"...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001628:text","row":29783,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「すごくおいしいなあ」","en":"“Really delicious.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800603","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00073","en":"Taichi: \"Way really delicious.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:00001674:text","row":29784,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"もぐもぐもぐもぐ","en":"Munch munch munch munch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800604","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00074","en":"Munch, munch, munch, munch.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000016a4:text","row":29785,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800605","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00075","en":"Youko: \"...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000016e2:text","row":29786,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"人気のない廊下に佇む二人。俺の咀嚼、曜子ちゃんの腹の虫、サンドイッチを取り出す紙袋の音。渾然一体となって和音を作る。","en":"There we stood in the deserted hall: my chewing, Youko's growling stomach, the rustle of the paper bag as I drew out another sandwich. The three sounds blended into a single chord.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800606","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00076","en":"The two of us loiter in a low-traffic corridor. Sounds audible are my chewing, Youko-chan's belly bug and the sandwiches being taken out of a paper bag. They work harmoniously to create a chord.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese idiom refers to a rumbling stomach; the literalized English phrase denotes no corresponding sound or bodily event.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":101,"start":92,"text":"belly bug"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:0000176e:text","row":29787,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"わけのわからん緊張が膨れあがっていく。","en":"An inexplicable tension swelled between us.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800607","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0032:00077","en":"A tension I don't understand is swelling.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000017d4:choice:01","row":29788,"ordinal":77,"kind":"choice","jp":"食べさせる","en":"Feed her","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0208:000017d4:choice:02","row":29789,"ordinal":78,"kind":"choice","jp":"食べる","en":"Eat it","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
